{
  "title": "北上资金大幅流出，用担心吗？数据说话。",
  "author": "顶底之王",
  "publish_time": "",
  "url": "http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxODM4ODM5Mg==&mid=2247484271&idx=1&sn=9ad00433cb87e08ae603c0546608faf2&chksm=f988eca8ceff65bec7f6122bd0138e0368e264373b4165fb6fcbc637c3f239d81d9a8699cca3&scene=27#wechat_redirect",
  "content_text": "上个月，北上资金大幅流出了\n450\n亿，很多朋友又怕了。说价值投资的外资都跑了，\nA\n股是不是还要跌？\n我们继续数据说话，统计历史发现，北上资金很少一个月总体流出，最近四年月度流出只出现了五次。\n第一次是\n2018\n年\n10\n月，流出\n105\n亿。\n第二次是\n2019\n年\n5\n月，流出\n530\n亿。\n第三次是\n2020\n年\n3\n月，流出\n680\n亿。\n第四次是\n2020\n年\n9\n月，流出\n330\n亿。\n第五次就是\n2022\n年\n3\n月，流出\n450\n亿。\n可以看到，前四次北上资金大幅流出的月份都是底部，而且每次流出之后，未来最少\n5\n个月都是连续净流入。\n再看北上资金流向和上证指数的对比图也能看出，他们几乎同步，也就是说大盘涨北上资金就流入，大盘大涨，北上资金就大幅流入，大盘跌，北上就流出，大盘大跌，北上就大幅流出。\n基本上没有任何参考价值。\n那不都说北上资金是聪明资金吗？怎么现在成了追涨杀跌的韭菜了？\n再来研究一下，有个别日子还是挺准的。\n比如\n2018\n年\n11-12\n月，大盘还在震荡下跌，北上资金大幅流入\n400\n亿，结果大盘见底。\n2021\n年\n3\n月\n9\n日和\n3\n月\n10\n日，大盘最后杀跌的两天，北上资金逆势流入\n60\n亿，大盘见底。\n2020\n年\n2\n月\n25\n日，创业板收长下影阳线，但北上资金逆势流出\n40\n亿，大盘见顶。\n2022\n年\n11\n月，沪深\n300\n下跌时北上资金逆势流入\n300\n亿，然后\n12\n月份起了一小波行情。\n也就是说，北上资金和大盘反着的时候，是有一些参考价值的。\n总结：\n1\n，北上资金一个月净流出之后都是底部，未来至少\n5\n个月都是净流入。\n2\n，当北上资金流向和大盘涨跌方向相同的时候，没有参考价值。\n3\n，偶尔有北上资金流向和大盘方向相反的时候，可以结合当时的情况做为顶底的参考。",
  "content_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \"><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">上个月，北上资金大幅流出了</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">450</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿，很多朋友又怕了。说价值投资的外资都跑了，</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">A</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">股是不是还要跌？</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">我们继续数据说话，统计历史发现，北上资金很少一个月总体流出，最近四年月度流出只出现了五次。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">第一次是</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2018</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月，流出</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">105</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">第二次是</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2019</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月，流出</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">530</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">第三次是</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2020</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月，流出</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">680</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">第四次是</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2020</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月，流出</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">330</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">第五次就是</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月，流出</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">450</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.4566787003610108\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMNCEUobRyo5YrPhmFJh5Hibib2l8lMEWl0UEDc4jyEJerqpmMRD1Bso93DVc9CMXXbZ0ZxNqrOxnTtw/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"554\" style=\"\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">可以看到，前四次北上资金大幅流出的月份都是底部，而且每次流出之后，未来最少</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">个月都是连续净流入。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">再看北上资金流向和上证指数的对比图也能看出，他们几乎同步，也就是说大盘涨北上资金就流入，大盘大涨，北上资金就大幅流入，大盘跌，北上就流出，大盘大跌，北上就大幅流出。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br/></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> <img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.38517179023508136\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMNCEUobRyo5YrPhmFJh5Hibib2QngCTrq6UwHgZ1wiaAXnao86HBCg8er2arckSpueruHibm6jz7Few1w/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"553\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">基本上没有任何参考价值。</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">那不都说北上资金是聪明资金吗？怎么现在成了追涨杀跌的韭菜了？</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">再来研究一下，有个别日子还是挺准的。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">比如</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2018</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">11-12</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月，大盘还在震荡下跌，北上资金大幅流入</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">400</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿，结果大盘见底。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.4927797833935018\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMNCEUobRyo5YrPhmFJh5HibibPXRFyEqOLSQ8SUIJIpRCbHWKU5orZ0iayFvTRWg4Uqc5Ed4klxiaEguw/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"554\" style=\"\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">日和</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">日，大盘最后杀跌的两天，北上资金逆势流入</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">60</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿，大盘见底。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.4548736462093863\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMNCEUobRyo5YrPhmFJh5Hibib4yWmAiaUNOy6HriayicQdLclkNGiaYxtbFPrPzVZC6gNPSKbDHdGHLKlMg/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"554\" style=\"\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2020</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">25</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">日，创业板收长下影阳线，但北上资金逆势流出</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;\">40</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">亿，大盘见顶。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.33754512635379064\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMNCEUobRyo5YrPhmFJh5Hibib95xFj3s6QT7zWMJWAcE2BjYDgq4yVjuShKStNkMWvibpVPMOhD954pQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"554